,000 for Z Fold 7 at [253.3s], and the Z Fold 7 can be found for ~$300 less on sale. Only one Samsung device is actually discussed. The distractor is whether there are two different Samsung devices with different prices. No hallucination: The prices are explicitly stated. Reasonableness: Tests precision in identifying what the prices refer to.", "quality": "high"}, {"id": 5, "difficulty": "medium", "query": "本集中提到了几个不同品牌的折叠手机？Samsung Z Fold 3的主人是谁？", "analysis": "长上下文依赖性：需要区分不同的Samsung折叠手机型号。Z Fold 3在[397.1s]被提到是Wynne Twittow的日常使用手机。干扰项是Z Fold 7和Z Fold 8Y，它们也是Samsung的。无幻觉验证：Wynne的使用历史在原文中明确提及。问题合理性：需要将特定型号与特定主持人关联。", "quality": "high"}]}
{"task_category": "retrieval", "task_subcategory": "position_aware_retrieval", "task_name": "位置感知检索", "samples": [{"id": 1, "difficulty": "easy", "query": "What topic is discussed immediately after the ad breaks at the beginning of the episode?", "analysis": "Long context dependency: The ads end around [104.3s], and the main content begins at [112.1s] with the introduction to the Motorola Razr Fold story. No hallucination: The transition is clear in the transcript. Reasonableness: Position-based question about episode structure.", "quality": "high"}, {"id": 2, "difficulty": "medium", "query": "在节目的最后一个广告之前，主持人讨论的最后一个话题是什么？", "analysis": "长上下文依赖性：需要确定广告的顺序。最后一个广告是Zinn Nicotine Pouches在[74.8s-104.3s]。在它之前是AllTrails广告在[59.2s-73.6s]。但这些不是节目内容讨论的话题。实际上，广告之前的最后一个节目内容讨论不在此窗口内（广告在最开头）。问题需要理解广告和内容的区分。无幻觉验证：广告顺序在原文中明确。问题合理性：测试对节目结构的理解。", "quality": "medium"}, {"id": 3, "difficulty": "hard", "query": "After discussing the camera comparison between the Motorola Razr Fold and Samsung Z Fold 7, what technology topic do the hosts transition to next?", "analysis": "Long context dependency: The camera discussion ends around [202.2s-202.8s], and the next topic is silicon carbon battery technology at [202.8s-231.9s]. This requires understanding the flow of the conversation. No hallucination: The transition is present in the transcript. Reasonableness: Tests understanding of conversational flow.", "quality": "high"}, {"id": 4, "difficulty": "medium", "query": "What is the last technical specification of the Motorola Razr Fold that is mentioned before the hosts discuss pricing?", "analysis": "Long context dependency: The last spec before pricing at [253.3s] is the camera discussion ending at [202.2s], with the low-light performance comparison at [202.8s]. Actually, the silicon carbon battery tech is discussed at [202.8s-231.9s] before the pricing segment. No hallucination: The sequence is clear. Reasonableness: Position-aware question about spec discussion order.", "quality": "high"}, {